      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 1351395377,
      "text": "Calophyllum soulattri is a species of flowering plant in the Calophyllaceae family. It is native to southern Indochina, Malesia, Papuasia, the Northern Territory of Australia, and Palau. It is considered one of the best bintangor timber species."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Calophyllum soulattri",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calophyllum_soulattri",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 211205867,
      "text": "Calophyllum soulattri est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des Clusiaceae, selon la classification classique, des Calophyllaceae, selon la classification phylogénétique."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Kapur naga",
